{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1483386-need-help-with-a-goblin","id":1483386,"title":"Need help with a Goblin","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-08T10:28:48-07:00","id":1483386,"title":"Need help with a Goblin","content":"So I have been having this idea for a Hobgoblin antagonist that was born from a child's fear of explosions and war from watching the news and similar. Basically what I am trying to come up with are good explosions themed goblin contracts, and could use help with the system for this <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-08T19:54:08-07:00","id":1483436,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Roar of Ai-Laau (Goblin)</span></b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The fae calls out to the ancient kupua of Kilauea, said to have been an ancient changeling whose deeds are shrouded in mystery. This causes an object to violently explode with tremendous force. </span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Cost:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 2 Glamour</span><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Dice Pool:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> N/A</span><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Action:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Reflexive</span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Effects:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Once per turn, the fae can touch a non-magical object and spend the Glamour cost, causing it to violently explode with the same force as a heavy frag grenade. This can be applied to an object being carried or worn by someone else, but requires a roll of</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i> Dexterity + Brawl - target\u2019s Defense</i>. However, since nothing protects the user from being hit by the explosion, most prefer to use throwing weapons instead, since there is just enough time to throw it. The fae can affect objects up to [Wyrd] in size.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Elemental:</b> Devastation always follows the wake of a volcano. Those more attuned to the natural forces can spend an additional Glamour to set both themselves and whoever is hit by the explosion on fire, a blaze with the intensity of a torch fire.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Loophole:</b> The fae is currently afflicted with the Extreme Heat tilt.</span><br /> <br /> <b>Observation: </b>Solf F. Kimblee from <i>Fullmetal Alchemist: Brootherhood</i> is a good source of inspiration on how this Contract can be used creatively.<br /> <br /> <b>Observation 2:</b> Additional sources of inspiration for Goblin Contracts could be the abilities of <a href=\"https://yuyuhakusho.fandom.com/wiki/Karasu#Techniques/Moves\" target=\"_blank\">Karasu</a> (<i>Yu Yu Hakusho</i>) and <a href=\"https://hunterxhunter.fandom.com/wiki/Genthru#Abilities_&amp;_Powers\" target=\"_blank\">Genthru </a>(<i>Hunter X Hunter</i>)</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 06-09-2022, 11:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-09T05:53:12-07:00","id":1483459,"title":"","content":"If you can use it with thrown weapons, I assume that you can delay the explosion for enough time to throw it, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theo